uVu1trk?t=278","https://youtu.be/DubdKKhMWHo?t=350"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"Carlisle rests players on back-to-backs, and IND has back-to-backs in playoff weeks 20 and 21.","sources":["https://youtu.be/EGdhmUgPAWY?t=2034"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}